 "discovery_notes": "Cell B360, follow-up 13 of B041 (packets 397/445/478/505/526); reuses their keys. 29 standard searches, snippet leads only (all claims from search-engine summaries, not quoted page text). New: HKDL Happiest Place on Earth Princess series (Mar 2021, set only, structure hold); HKDL Lady and the Tramp 65th LE pin (31 Jul 2020) and held 'Olu Mel LE pin; TDR Happy Ride with Baymax grand opening OE pin (28 Sep 2020, 1,000 yen); TDR 2020 spinner and Mickey-flowers year pins (Jan 2020); TDR Minnie Summer 2021 and Easter 2022 pins (titles only); Toy Story Traffic Cones set and Disney 100 dangle (held). Corroboration: Fun Day 2020 theme pin single LE 800 Chinese-style Mickey (sh.bendibao); Doll's Day 2020 two-pin OE set. Pooh candy machine 600/800 conflict may be a mapping error. Not found: HKDL Jun/Dec 2022 and Sep-Nov 2021 batches, Nov 2022 birthday three, third LinaBell, SHDR LinaBell 2021, Fun Day 2022 contents, TDS20 framed five, Halloween 2022 balloon four, park-logo fourth. Resellers seen, not used: usshoppingsos, carousell, wickedpins, fryguypins, castleplanethk, wizmouse, fril, Yahoo auctions, ilovecharacters."
